# .ngodingpakeaiignore — extra paths to keep out of NgodingPakeAI sync.
# Uses .gitignore syntax. Secrets, node_modules, build output and .env files
# are ALWAYS blocked by the CLI regardless of what is listed here.

# Local credentials and machine-specific configuration
**/key.properties
**/local.properties
**/*.env
**/*.env.*

# Generated Flutter, Dart, Android, Apple, and IDE state
**/.dart_tool/
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Generated.xcconfig
**/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# Compiled and generated build output
**/build/
**/*.dill
**/*.stamp
**/*.lock
